OL,3,GNEWSARare cancer discovered after mum
OL,4,Aunderwent hysterectomy
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonna Marklew had to undergo a
OL,7,Fhysterectomy to treat complications
OL,8,Fcaused by childbirth.
OL,10,FBut the operation led the Coventry mum
OL,11,Fto receive a life-changing diagnosis
OL,12,Fwhen tests later revealed she had a
OL,13,Frare form of cancer.
OL,15,FShe was diagnosed with neuroendocrine
OL,16,Fcancer, which was only discovered after
OL,17,Ftissue removed during a hysterectomy at
OL,18,FWarwick Hospital was analysed following
OL,19,Fa uterine prolapse.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
